{"content":[{"c":["SPINNER, SPINNING"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Fibers were spun into yarn by women in all periods of Israel’s history, but a class of professional spinners arose alongside them. Women spinners are mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.35.25-26","r":"Exod.35.25-26","rawR":"Exod.35.25-26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.35.25-26","value":"Exod.35.25-26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Exodus 35:25-26"},". Among her other virtues, the good wife of ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.31.1-31","r":"Pr.31.1-31","rawR":"Pr.31.1-31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.31.1-31","value":"Pr.31.1-31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Proverbs 31"}," engaged in spinning (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.31.19","r":"Pr.31.19","rawR":"Pr.31.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.31.19","value":"Pr.31.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 31:19"},"). Jesus spoke of the lilies of the field that did not need to spin (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.6.28","r":"Matt.6.28","rawR":"Matt.6.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.6.28","value":"Matt.6.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 6:28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.12.27","r":"Luke.12.27","rawR":"Luke.12.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.12.27","value":"Luke.12.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 12:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SpinnerSpinning","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Exodus 35:25-26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.35.25-26","rawQueryValue":"Exod.35.25-26","sourceRefExact":"Exod.35.25-26"},{"anchorText":"Proverbs 31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.31.1-31","rawQueryValue":"Pr.31.1-31","sourceRefExact":"Pr.31.1-31"},{"anchorText":"Prv 31:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.31.19","rawQueryValue":"Pr.31.19","sourceRefExact":"Pr.31.19"},{"anchorText":"Mt 6:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstr